### Environment files and secrets ###
# Real settings live in .env files next to each component; only the
# *.env.example templates are committed. Copy one to .env and fill it in.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Private keys are never committed. Generate one per environment and point
# the component at it (see README, "Environment files").
*private*.pem
*private-key*.pem
# Local-development keys and the client registration made from them
# (collab-ui/local-dev/local_keys.py)
collab-ui/local-dev/keys/
# Database dumps for the local data stack (never committed)
docker/dumps/
# Helm value files filled in for a real environment
values-*.yaml
!values-*.example.yaml

### Python ###
__pycache__/
*.pyc
